{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VBCbQiMq3OGR1T8sApIFhQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:11.987849+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VBCbQiMq3OGR1T8sApIFhQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院及学科简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wAu25Yvc8mgsV2Z6ibTJROibiavXST5m6JkPgZMHZ0SEUYbjbsXVtlrOMrLcSDiaaNXicicf3iczJ9zicIvo45t65XJ4Bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>东华大学是教育部直属、国家“</span></span><span><span>211</span></span><span><span>工程”、国家“双一流”建设高校，是中国首批具有博士、硕士、学士三级学位授予权的大学之一，材料科学与工程学院成立于</span><span><span>1994</span></span><span>年，源于</span></span><span><span>1954</span></span><span><span>年我国著名纤维科学家和教育家钱宝钧、方柏容教授创建的新中国第一个化学纤维专业。材料科学与工程一级学科是我国首批博士学位授予点（</span></span><span><span>1981</span></span><span><span>年）、首批国家重点学科（</span></span><span><span>1986</span></span><span><span>年），并于</span></span><span><span>2022</span></span><span><span>年入选国家“双一流”学科建设名单、全球</span></span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span>前千分之一学科。材料科学与工程学院（以下简称“材料学院”）开设高分子材料与工程、无机非金属材料工程、复合材料与工程、功能材料四个国家级一流本科专业，以及新材料现代产业学院（全国首批）。拥有“材料科学与工程”、“纳米科学与工程”、“化学”</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>个一级学科博士点、及“材料与化工”、“能源动力”</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>个专业学位博士点，涵盖“材料学”、“材料加工工程”、“材料物理与化学”、“纳米纤维及杂化材料”、“功能与智能材料”、“生物与仿生材料”、“无机化学”、“高分子化学与物理”等</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>个二级学科硕士点和“材料与化工”专业学位硕士点。现有研究生导师</span></span><span><span>170</span></span><span><span>余名，含中国两院院士</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>名，国家级人才</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>余名。建有先进纤维材料全国重点实验室、高性能纤维及制品教育部重点实验室和先进玻璃制造技术教育部工程研究中心等</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>个国家、省部级科研基地。材料学院致力于创建有特色、高水平、开放型的学科体系，以纤维和高分子材料为特色，以先进无机非金属材料、复合材料、纳米材料、智能和生物医用材料为支撑，以能源和信息材料为新增长点，紧密结合国家战略、国防建设和社会发展需求开展科学研究，培养了以美国工程院院士程正迪、中国工程院院士季国标和中国科学院院士何鸣元、朱美芳、彭慧胜为代表，具有创新思维、研究型和应用型并重的高层次人才</span></span><span><span>1.4</span></span><span><span>余万人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料学院</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年夏令营旨在促进各高校材料类及相近专业本科生之间的沟通和交流，让广大优秀学子近距离了解东华大学材料学院，增强科研兴趣，拓展研究视野，选拔有培养潜质的优秀学生继续深造。热烈欢迎有志于来我院深造的同学报名参加！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营规模</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wAu25Yvc8mgsV2Z6ibTJROibiavXST5m6JkPgZMHZ0SEUYbjbsXVtlrOMrLcSDiaaNXicicf3iczJ9zicIvo45t65XJ4Bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>本次夏令营计划招收营员</span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span>名左右，将于</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span>-18</span></span><span><span><span>日</span>线下举行。活动期</span></span></span><span><span>间我院将安排专题宣讲会、学术报告会、创新学术论坛、校园参观等活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营申请流程及政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wAu25Yvc8mgsV2Z6ibTJROibiavXST5m6JkPgZMHZ0SEUYbjbsXVtlrOMrLcSDiaaNXicicf3iczJ9zicIvo45t65XJ4Bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>申请参加我院夏令营的学生应具备以下基本条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）全国高等院校将于</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年毕业的应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）学习成绩优秀，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）有意向申报我校推荐免试研究生或报考我校硕士研究生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）材料、化学、物理、生物、环境等相关专业。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起至</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>16</span></span><span>点。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>（1）身份证正反面扫描件、学生证（封面和个人信息页）扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科前五学期成绩单原件、专业排名证明（均须加盖校教务部门或院系公章）扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）外语水平证明，如</span><span><span>CET</span></span><span>、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物、专利或其他原创性成果；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）考生认为可以证明自身学业水平和能力等方面的其他材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>上述材料请扫描成图片，按顺序放置于</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件内，自行添加封面（封面内容包含申请人姓名、申请学院、申请专业、毕业学校、毕业专业、联系方式）。排版尽量紧凑，页数不限。图片不宜过小须能看清字迹内容。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>有意向参加我校“全国优秀大学生夏令营”的学生请登录东华大学研究生报考服务系统——夏令营申请模块提交申请。网址：</span><span><span>https://yzbm.dhu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span>。先注册，后填报。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>入选名单公布办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院将根据夏令营规模对申请审查筛选，择优录取。申请人届时可登录报名系统查询是否入选。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wAu25Yvc8mgsV2Z6ibTJROibiavXST5m6JkPgZMHZ0SEUYbjbsXVtlrOMrLcSDiaaNXicicf3iczJ9zicIvo45t65XJ4Bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>021-67792362</span></span><span>转</span><span><span>803</span></span><span>（古老师）</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子邮件：</span><span><span>gumingzhu@dhu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：上海市松江区人民北路</span><span><span>2999</span></span><span>号东华大学材料学院</span><span><span>C306</span></span><span>室</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/wAu25Yvc8mgsV2Z6ibTJROibiavXST5m6JkPgZMHZ0SEUYbjbsXVtlrOMrLcSDiaaNXicicf3iczJ9zicIvo45t65XJ4Bw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、申请人应保证所提交信息和资料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，任何阶段，一经发现，依照有关规定严肃追责。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、若教育部、学校有新文件精神，相关政策按新文件精神执行。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>欢迎广大学生踊跃报名参加！</span></span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>东华大学材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p><span>先进纤维材料全国重点实验室</span></p><p><span>2025年6月25日</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"76e3df894bf94d153038d0e760e0f89ba9dea14ca49dada4e326bdb78e1401e2","textLength":1739,"sourceSha256":"a9274916b89df9e60d89cb9915814275e9d8a774febebc507d7c3576cf7d0e6d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f2bd013d94e342b82af3","title":"2025年东华大学材料科学与工程学院2025年度“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:11.987849+00:00"}
